HMI Magnetogram Polarity Time-Stack Visualization
README for the code and data repository
Ehsan Tavabi
MATLAB code and data for reproducing the 3D polarity time-stack (“butterfly”-style) figures based
on SDO/HMI line-of-sight magnetograms.
The script HMI_polarity_visualization_sunspot_20250917.m reads a time series of HMI FITS
magnetograms, separates positive and negative polarity pixels, builds two binary volumes (x, y,
time), smooths them, and renders them as 3D isosurfaces stacked along the time axis (red = positive
polarity, blue = negative polarity). A context image (ds9.tiff) is drawn as a semi-transparent base
plane.
