1 Contents of the archive
After unzipping HMI_DATA.zip you should obtain (names in <...> are to be matched to your actual
archive):
HMI_DATA/
|-- HMI_Fits/ # HMI FITS magnetograms, 2025-09-17 to 2025-09-19 (*.fits)
|-- ds9.tiff # Context image used as base plane (rendered with SAOImage DS9)
|-- <header_file_2025> # JSOC header/query information for the 2025 dataset
‘-- 2017_05_19/
|-- HMI_Fits/ # HMI FITS magnetograms, 2017-05-19 (*.fits)
|-- ds9.tiff
‘-- <header_file_2017> # JSOC header/query information for the 2017 dataset
HMI_polarity_visualization_sunspot_20250917.m
